messages:
maria: getting a handful of CF Workers reports: SDK crashes with 'require is not defined' and TS errors referencing Node types.
kevin: that's expected if users bundle CJS into a worker. Workers are ESM-only in many deploy flows.
sam: action: publish an ESM entrypoint, add conditional exports, and produce a worker-specific bundle that strips node-only deps.
olivia: note: CF has no process/fs/Buffer. Also global fetch and ReadableStream exist but differ. Avoid bundling node-fetch or stream polyfills into the worker build.
maria: minimal repro user sent uses CJS require in a worker and fails on deploy.
kevin: short-term docs: tell workers users to `import { RedwoodClient } from 'redwood'` and to pass `fetch` + env explicitly: `new RedwoodClient({ apiKey: env.REDWOOD_KEY, fetch: globalThis.fetch })`.
sam: packaging plan: add exports map -> import -> dist/redwood.esm.mjs, require -> dist/redwood.cjs.js, and a worker/browser conditional -> dist/redwood.worker.mjs so bundlers pick the right file.
olivia: types: our .d.ts references NodeJS.ReadableStream. For edge publish a types/worker.d.ts with minimal ambient declarations to avoid TS conflicts.
maria: runtime adapter idea: choose fetch at runtime: `const isEdge = typeof process === 'undefined' && typeof globalThis?.fetch === 'function'; const fetchImpl = opts.fetch ?? (isEdge ? globalThis.fetch : nodeFetch);`
kevin: change retry layer to not depend on node-fetch internals; prefer standard AbortController and let user pass fetch.
sam: testing: add a CI job using miniflare to run smoke tests against the worker bundle (generate + stream token tests). That should catch Node-only regressions.
olivia: sample quickstart to add to README for Workers (ESM):
```js
import { RedwoodClient } from 'redwood';
export default {
  async fetch(req, env) {
    const client = new RedwoodClient({ apiKey: env.REDWOOD_KEY, fetch: globalThis.fetch });
    const res = await client.generate('hello from worker');
    return new Response(res.text);
  }
}
```
maria: I'll draft the support KB and examples/worker quickstart. sam/kevin/olivia will PR packaging, example, and types. ci-bot: started worker smoke job on branch fix/edge-shim.
maria: thanks everyone — once PRs land we'll update support tickets with a migration snippet. :rocket:
